  "_what": "The rank ratchet for find_tools (dec:idea-prune-the-tool-surface-to-an-orthogonal-essential-set, 2026-09-18). not_first: served tools NOT ranked first for their own corpus query \u2014 each beaten on a name match by a tool whose name carries the query's word at five times a description hit. mutual: pairs where each tool lands in the other's top 5 for its own query. Both lists may only SHRINK: a new tool must rank first for its job and must not enter a mutual pair, and an entry here that has become first (or a pair that has come apart) must be removed. Regenerate with tools/tool_confusability.py --baseline after a description pass. The in-memory ranker is the authority: it may find a pair the offline replica misses (tie-breaking), and such a pair stays listed by hand.",
